      "title": "Strongest 12V car vacuum I have tested — handles sand and gravel",
      "body": "I tested 6 different car vacuums and this one has the highest suction at 5000Pa. It pulls sand from the carpet, crumbs from the seat crevices, and even pet hair. The washable HEPA filter is a huge plus. See the before/after photos of my truck bed.",
